# Ovee v3 Toolkit Rules

- Use Ovee v3 APIs for new or migrated code: `defineComponent` and `defineModule`.
- Do not introduce new class decorator components (`@register`, `extends Component`) in `packages/`.
- Do not introduce new `lit-html` / `TemplateComponent` usage.
- For base components, keep behavior parity with existing event contracts while migrating internals to v3 patterns.
- Keep `packages/core/components/base/index.ts` and `packages/core/components/index.ts` exports consistent with migration state.
- Prefer existing v3 files as references:
  - `packages/core/components/other/nav-toggle/NavToggle.ts`
  - `packages/core/components/utils/in-viewport/InViewport.ts`
  - `packages/core/modules/viewport-units/ViewportUnits.ts`
- For script templates in `scripts/`, emit v3-oriented boilerplate and avoid stale v2 docs links.
- Use official docs for API checks:
  - https://owlsdepartment.github.io/ovee/v3/
